* **Dimensional Analysis:**
    * **Force (F):**  The unit of force is Newtons (N), which is defined as mass (M) * velocity (V) = M * (length (L) / time (T)) = [MLT^-2].
    * **Normal Force (N):** The normal force is the force acting perpendicular to a surface. It is a force, so it has the same units as force: [MLT^-2].
