   [Friction] = [F] / [N] = [MLT^-2] / [MLT^-2] = [M^0L^0T^0]
* **Dimensional Dimensionless:** This means the coefficient of friction is a dimensionless quantity. It is a ratio of two quantities with the same units, so it has no physical units.

