*  sin(ωt) = (1 / (2i)) * [e^(iωt) - e^(-iωt)]
*  cos(ωt) = (1 / (2)) * [e^(iωt) + e^(-iωt)]

Applying these to our function:

f(t) = 3sin(2πt) + 2cos(4πt)
